<title>SPAIN: Spain approves 1997 budget draft - spokesman.</title>
<headline>Spain approves 1997 budget draft - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's government approved on Friday the draft of its 1997 budget, government spokesman Miguel Angel Rodriguez said.</p>
<p>The government has pledged an austere budget which will assure Spain's inclusion in the launch of a single European currency planned for 1999.</p>
</text>
